1
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:43,760
Xiaoyan,

2
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,780
I was a jerk yesterday.

3
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,320
I lost my mind for a moment.

4
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:50,720
I promise I won't hit you again.

5
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:51,640
Come back with me.

6
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,480
Let's live a good life together, okay?

7
00:00:53,480 --> 00:00:55,880
I used to think you were like a mountain,

8
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:58,080
like an unshakable tree.

9
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,400
It's only now that I realize

10
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,680
you're actually so short,

11
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:03,680
so small, and so vulnerable.

12
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,530
I'm not going back with you.

13
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,730
Let's get a divorce.

14
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:07,600
Divorce?

15
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,000
Who else would want

16
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,360
a divorcee like you?

17
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:13,280
I've had enough of being a wife.

18
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,960
I'm going to be a poet,

19
00:01:14,960 --> 00:01:16,120
a photographer.

20
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:17,760
I want to travel

21
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:19,120
and see the world.

22
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,460
If you leave today,

23
00:01:23,560 --> 00:01:27,020
don't ever think about stepping foot
in the Zhang house again.

24
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:35,960
Don't ever think about
stepping foot in my house.

25
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,160
You're still smiling.

26
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:37,920
Ms. Qian left.

27
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,479
You have to do all the work
yourself again.

28
00:01:39,479 --> 00:01:40,759
I'm happy for Ms. Qian.

29
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,259
I'm willing to do
as much work as it takes.

30
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:49,240
What time are you planning
to deliver food tonight?

31
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:50,720
Delivering food is too exhausting.

32
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,840
Don't push yourself.

33
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,880
Just stay at home.

34
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:53,759
I'm not tired.

35
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:55,120
I think it's quite fun.

36
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:55,720
You know,

37
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:57,960
I recently found
a perfect spot for a stall.

38
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:59,920
There's a lot of foot traffic there.

39
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:03,380
Let's think about setting up a stall
there in the next few days.

40
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,600
Won't that be too tiring for you?

41
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:09,479
Not at all. I think it's quite fun.

42
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:16,600
Son,

43
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,360
what brings you here?

44
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,560
I just came to see you.

45
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:21,920
Is someone here?

46
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,360
I thought I heard a voice.

47
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:26,640
Nobody. Let's go upstairs first.

48
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,320
Ms. Qian's poems are quite good.

49
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:53,320
Delivery.

50
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,480
Thank you.

51
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,200
Qingqing,

52
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,329
long time no see.

53
00:03:24,440 --> 00:03:26,400
My friend and I went to Turkey.

54
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:27,640
It's beautiful here.

55
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,360
I wanted to share it with you,

56
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,920
so I drew it.

57
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,120
I thought I had cancer

58
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:35,200
and didn't want to waste
my remaining time,

59
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:38,040
so I gathered the courage
to leave everything behind.

60
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,960
But it wasn't until I got here

61
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,320
that I realized I wasn't
the one with cancer.

62
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,120
He is.

63
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,200
He knew my pain

64
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,240
and my struggles.

65
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,360
He lied to me

66
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,560
so I would take that brave step.

67
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,520
He's so silly.

68
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:53,560
By the time you read this postcard,

69
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:56,240
we will have already left for Santorini.

70
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,960
I want to walk the last leg
of life's journey

71
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,400
with him.

72
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:36,680
I'm sorry. I was too impulsive just now.

73
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:51,810
I stayed downstairs for a long time

74
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,360
and thought a lot.

75
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,320
I was wondering

76
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:56,520
what exactly I've been doing lately.

77
00:04:56,840 --> 00:04:58,320
Why do I keep giving,

78
00:04:58,320 --> 00:05:00,250
only to be treated like this by you?

79
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:02,640
You know, it feels like

80
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,360
seeing a beautiful clam

81
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,720
by the sea.

82
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:07,200
I tried desperately to open it

83
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:09,060
to see if there was a pearl inside.

84
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,060
But what happened?

85
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:12,160
I didn't even see

86
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:14,000
a hint of a pearl, but got my hands cut

87
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,960
by the shell over and over.

88
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:28,320
I feel like trash right now,

89
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:30,320
being hidden away by you in a panic.

90
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,659
Yue Shanchuan,

91
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:34,520
no one has ever treated me like this

92
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,800
in my entire life.

93
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,200
I'm sorry.

94
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:43,170
I don't want to hear
those words right now.

95
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,760
What are you hiding from?

96
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:48,159
What are you afraid of?

97
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,040
Am I so unpresentable

98
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:51,640
that you refuse to accept me?

99
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,200
I'm just someone with no confidence

100
00:05:57,880 --> 00:05:59,360
who has given up on myself.

101
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,000
I told you a long time ago

102
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:03,450
that we are not from the same world.

103
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,480
But I've tried so hard

104
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:08,160
to get closer to your world.

105
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,280
I took ninety-nine steps toward you,

106
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:14,210
but you refuse to take
even one step toward me, right?

107
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,320
You're hurt.

108
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:30,040
Slap me first, then offer me a sweet?

109
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:31,800
I'm not falling for that.

110
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:42,400
Why are you back so suddenly?

111
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,040
Did you win Yue Shanchuan over?

112
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:46,480
I didn't win him over. I let him go.

113
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,120
That's good too.

114
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:52,920
With your qualities,

115
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:54,120
you can find any guy you want.

116
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,980
There are plenty better than him.

117
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,000
What about you and Shen Feng?

118
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,200
We're just friends.

119
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,000
You can only fool us.

120
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,000
Just don't end up fooling yourself.

121
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:11,080
Things between us are a bit complicated.

122
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:13,280
I don't know

123
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,800
if I like his soul

124
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,890
or just lust after his body.

125
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,480
Are they mutually exclusive?

126
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,280
You can like his soul

127
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:21,360
and lust after his body.

128
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:23,220
What about you and Yue Shanchuan?

129
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:26,400
Which one is it, or both?

130
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:28,880
Us?

131
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:32,360
At first, I really just wanted
to have fun with him

132
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,560
and enjoy the moment.

133
00:07:34,159 --> 00:07:36,960
But the more I interact with him,
the more I realize

134
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,659
I've actually fallen for him.

135
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:42,440
But this relationship

136
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,960
will never get any positive feedback.

137
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,159
It's too exhausting.

138
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,280
Relationships aren't actually
that complicated.

139
00:07:47,280 --> 00:07:49,400
You just need to follow your heart.

140
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:53,000
People are like food.

141
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:55,159
You have to taste it yourself

142
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:58,400
to know if you really like it.

143
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,480
Makes sense.

144
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:21,200
Come on, cheers.

145
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,720
Did you eat bitter melon
or something today?

146
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,320
Why do you look so miserable?

147
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:46,040
She asked the flight base
to change her instructor.

148
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:48,180
Isn't that what you asked for?

149
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,080
Yeah.

150
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,600
I thought

151
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:53,200
we'd just go back to our own worlds

152
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,000
and never cross paths again.

153
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,800
That would be the best outcome.

154
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:59,800
But watching her walk further away,
I just...

155
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,040
You're just

156
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,040
asking for it.

157
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:07,080
You ignored her when she was around,

158
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:09,410
and now you're crying when she's gone.

159
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,880
Have you ever thought about

160
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,040
the real reason

161
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,720
why you can't be with Shu Rong?

162
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,520
It's been so many years.

163
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,680
Why are you afraid
to start a new relationship?

164
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:20,320
Your own fundamental problem
hasn't been solved.

165
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,960
Today it's Shu Rong.

166
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,840
Tomorrow it could be Wang Rong, Li Rong,
or Zhang Rong.

167
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,370
The result will be the same.

168
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:37,800
Shanchuan, your mom is a bottomless pit.

169
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:38,680
It's been so many years.

170
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:40,340
Haven't you ever doubted her?

171
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,400
She constantly claims she's sick

172
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:44,120
and then asks you for money.

173
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:45,040
But when have you ever seen her

174
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:47,500
actually hospitalized or taking medicine?

175
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,480
Stop drinking.

176
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,880
Anyone with eyes can see it clearly,

177
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:56,360
but you keep playing the fool
over and over again.

178
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,120
Sometimes I don't know
if you're really clueless

179
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,480
or just unwilling to face it.

180
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,000
She's my mom, after all.

181
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,400
Yes, you treat her like a mom.

182
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:05,800
But does she treat you like a son?

183
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,280
Back when you wanted to be a pilot,

184
00:10:08,280 --> 00:10:10,000
how much you suffered and sweated,

185
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,280
you know it yourself.

186
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:12,440
You finally got the chance

187
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,960
to study at a higher institution.

188
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:14,960
But what about your mom?

189
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:17,440
To tie you down and keep you local,

190
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,440
she actually teamed up with your sister

191
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,040
to change your application.

192
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:22,800
How many more times are you going
to make this mistake?

193
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:23,880
For so many years,

194
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,240
your unconditional obedience

195
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:27,000
has only brought you

196
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,600
deception after deception.

197
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:30,880
You've already given up
a great future for her.

198
00:10:30,880 --> 00:10:31,680
Are you going to give up

199
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:33,680
a lifetime of happiness for her too?

200
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:55,080
Yue Shanchuan,

201
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:56,880
it's so late.

202
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,160
What's the matter?

203
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,680
Why are you so drunk?

204
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:01,440
You stink.

205
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,480
I'm looking for Shu Rong.

206
00:11:03,560 --> 00:11:04,960
I have something for her.

207
00:11:07,160 --> 00:11:08,690
Shu Rong is already asleep.

208
00:11:11,200 --> 00:11:13,840
Tell you what, give it to me,

209
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,640
and I'll pass it to her tomorrow.

210
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:21,600
No. I have to give it to her myself.

211
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,320
It's already so late,

212
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:26,320
and Yunbianshang doesn't serve drunks.

213
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,440
You'd better go back.

214
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,240
Just go home.

215
00:11:28,440 --> 00:11:30,160
Be good and go home.

216
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:33,760
I want to stay.

217
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,960
Shen Feng is also drunk.

218
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:40,680
He's completely wasted.

219
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:44,290
Huo Huo is just a kid,
he really can't take care of him.

220
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:48,200
You're a drunk yourself,
take care of yourself first.

221
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,480
I'll go check

222
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:51,400
on Shen Feng.

223
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,200
That works.

224
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:56,200
It's just too dangerous.

225
00:11:56,680 --> 00:11:57,480
I'm leaving.

226
00:11:58,560 --> 00:11:59,000
Okay.

227
00:11:59,600 --> 00:12:00,280
Bye.

228
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,600
Bye.

229
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,850
I'll go take a look then.

230
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,480
What's up?

231
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,680
I've packed up all the things

232
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:38,200
you left at my place.

233
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,860
No need. Just throw them away.

234
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:43,360
Shurong, are you still mad at me?

235
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:46,760
Does it matter to you
whether I'm mad or not?

236
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:48,760
What's the point of saying this now?

237
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:49,920
Here,

238
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:51,560
your favorite crayfish.

239
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,800
I peeled them for you.

240
00:12:53,560 --> 00:12:54,560
Want a bite?

241
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:59,370
I can have anyone peel crayfish
for me if I want to.

242
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:10,240
Yue Shanchuan, what are you doing?

243
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,480
If you want to act crazy drunk,
do it outside.

244
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,280
Not here.

245
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:16,320
Shurong,

246
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,680
the question you asked me

247
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,880
at the fireworks show last time,

248
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:22,210
I actually answered it.

249
00:13:22,520 --> 00:13:24,360
It was just drowned out by the fireworks.

250
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:25,760
Do you still want to know?

251
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:29,400
Whatever the answer is,

252
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,520
it doesn't matter anymore.

253
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:32,120
And I don't want to know.

254
00:13:34,600 --> 00:13:35,200
I'm sorry.

255
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:37,720
I was too much of a coward.

256
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:39,400
I don't deserve you.

257
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,700
But maybe we can still be friends.

258
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,720
You think you deserve to be my friend?

259
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:47,240
Who do you think you are, Yue Shanchuan?

260
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,400
Get out.

261
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,200
Get out!

262
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,280
Get out!

263
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:26,400
Here, have some honey water.

264
00:14:27,360 --> 00:14:29,200
Just a little bit.

265
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:37,520
I've really had enough of you
and Yue Shanchuan.

266
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:39,250
Other guys bond like brothers,

267
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,480
but you two

268
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:42,560
just drink all day.

269
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:43,980
It's all his fault.

270
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:47,440
I told him life is short,

271
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:51,520
and he told me to fill it up, fill it up.

272
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,720
Don't move around. Careful not to fall.

273
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:56,320
Shen

274
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:58,080
Feng,

275
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:03,020
you passed out so fast.

276
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,440
Qingqing,

277
00:15:19,240 --> 00:15:21,120
love isn't actually that complicated.

278
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:23,000
You just need to follow your heart.

279
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,200
People are like food.

280
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:27,120
